# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in the real value. Vite only
# exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to client code, and only bakes them in at
# build time -- set this before `npm run build`, not at runtime.
#
# Free key from https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey -- without it the map
# still works, just with "API KEY REQUIRED" burned across the tiles. See
# the comment above the tileLayer call in src/components/LocationMap.jsx.
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=
